   "description": "<p>Now you can repair your faulty touch mechanism on the iPhone 16e without having to change the entire display! The iPhone 16e also has a separate touch and display panel that integrates and works as a whole unit. If your phone has a faulty, unresponsive, broken, or damaged touch, you need not replace the whole display unit. ifixit.bd has a dedicated service to replace or repair your touch panel (not the entire display) at in-service points located all over Dhaka, Bangladesh.</p><p></p><p><strong>Signs that indicate a faulty touch mechanism in the iPhone 16e are...</strong></p><p>Doesn’t work or has no response; / Program doesn’t open or respond after touching the icon </p><p>Delayed response or wrong response (Clicking on one place but the phone registers the touch elsewhere and opens an unrelated app) </p><p>Takes multiple touch attempts to open an app or perform an action on the phone </p><p>Ghost Touch / Delayed Touch Issue</p><p></p><p></p><p>If you see any of the signs on your phone, you can safely assume that the touch mechanism is faulty and should be replaced. Apple uses Haptic Touch on the iPhone 16e, and Haptic Touch ensures that there’s no struggle to operate the phone by touching it.</p>",
   "status": true,
